window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Camila was 17 when Van Quiso kidnapped her.</b></p> <p>Ten years after her escape, the shackles refuse to release her. Not while there are still slave traders preying on her city.</p> <p>She will stop at nothing to end them. Even if that means becoming a slave again.</p> <p>Returning to chains is her worst fear—and only option. They won’t know who she is or what she intends to do. She’s prepared for every complication.</p> <p>Except him. The one who decimated her 16-year-old heart.</p> <p>Matias is charming, gorgeous, and dangerously seductive. He’s also untrustworthy and enshrouded in secrets. After years of no contact, he finds her—on her knees, wrists bound, in the clutches of her enemy.</p> <p>Will he sabotage her mission by needlessly saving her?</p> <p>Or will he keep her in chains and never let her go?</p> <p><i>HEA with no cliffhanger. Must be listened to in order.</i></p>"; 
